{"kind": "mod", "id": 265, "name": "Free Healing", "slug": "free-healing", "teaser": "You don't need to pay for healing", "owner_name": "Revingly", "downloads": 15028, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "University of Illinois/NCSA Open Source License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/423.png", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:28.000000Z", "created_at": "2021-10-23T09:06:59.000000Z", "published_at": "2021-10-23T09:06:59.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "2.6.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/ncsa/", "description_html": "<p>Are you poor? Do you hate paying money every time you die and have to heal up in order to go raiding again.</p>\n<p>Well I have the solution for you then, with this mod you can heal up for free no matter how many times you die.</p>\n<p>### How to install:</p>\n<p>1. extract the zip file</p>\n<p>2. copy the folder to user/mods</p>\n<p>3. have fun</p>\n<p>PS: if you are perhaps looking for the hardcore version of this mod, then you can check <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/286-expensive-healing/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Expensive Healing</a> mod</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.4.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2525, "published_at": "2023-10-15T06:25:41.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/265/free-healing/2.4.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.5.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2107, "published_at": "2024-08-05T02:44:07.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/265/free-healing/2.5.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": n